{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45576","headline":"洛阳尘 · 贯休","name":"洛阳尘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时昔时洛城人，今作茫茫洛城尘。\n我闻富有石季伦，楼台五色干星辰。\n乐如天乐日夜闻，锦姝绣妾何纷纷。\n真珠帘中，姑射神人。\n文金线玉，香成暮云。\n孙秀若不杀，晋室应更贫。\n伊水削行路，塚石花磷磷。\n苍茫金谷园，牛羊齕荆榛。\n飞鸟好羽毛，疑是绿珠身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}